        "raw": "<p>Why would he have to wait until it&#39;s his turn to activate the Crocodile effect? The crux of my questions is, can you activate colored animal effects when it is not your turn if those effects are put into play? The text &quot;You may activate Green Crocodile effects&quot; does not specify that they have to be YOUR Green Crocodile effects or even effects on your cards, or that they have to be put into play during your turn.</p>",
