        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T00:07:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I mentioned recently in another thread, when you look at the *rulebook* discussion of Naturalist, it says that you can activate matching effects \"when <strong>you</strong> (emphasis added) play a card with an icon that matches the form THE NATURALIST is currently in\".&nbsp; If Guise was able to play a card with such an icon, he could use the power that matched The Naturalist.&nbsp; Don't think he can, though.</p>",
