        "created_at": "2015-01-21T01:14:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>He can use natural form’s power, though. It would function just like as if The Naturalist used it. Guise deals the damage. He can use the start of turn stuff, since the text for that is above the start-of-turn destroy-this-card text, but it would only apply to him, not the Naturalist. Basically, he just copies The Naturalist. Anything he can do, Guise can do. No extra shenanigans.</p>\n<p>He can benefit from Natural-Born Vigor’s start of turn effect, though, which is awesome.</p>",
